  "title": "Precision Drilling Corporation Holding Virtual-Only 2026 Annual Meeting of Shareholders on May 14",
  "summary": "CALGARY, Alberta, May 05, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Precision Drilling Corporation (Precision) would like to remind shareholders that it is holding its virtual 2026 Annual Meeting of Shareholders (the Annual Meeting) on Thursday, May 14, 2026 at 10:00 a.m. MST. The Annual Meeting can be accessed by logging in online at https://meetnow.global/M9JFRVX. Registered shareholders and […]",
